              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Molly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just wanting to use up some cream cheese and a few pea pods, I found this recipe. I just washed and dried the peas pods, didn't let them soak. I just added the filling to a small ziplock bag and squeezed away. A nice refreshing treat.",
