              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lori H"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made these for my \"sweet pea\" baby shower. Prepped pods as directed and between prepping, soaking and filling - I had at least 3 hours in this! Wasn't worth the time and for a 30 person shower (double batch) and folks didn't really like them - had a ton left over. Might be okay for a smaller shower.",
